  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Development Association, IDA21, 2026-2034</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">International Development Association, IDA21, 2026-2034</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med st&#xf6;det &#xe4;r att bist&#xe5; V&#xe4;rldsbankens fattigaste medlemsl&#xe4;nder med l&#xe5;ngsiktig utveckling och fattigdomsbek&#xe4;mpning. IDA:s arbete inbegriper f&#xf6;rm&#xe5;nlig utl&#xe5;ning, bidrag, teknisk assistans och policydialog.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the support is to assist the World Bank&apos;s poorest member countries in long-term development and poverty reduction. IDA&apos;s work includes concessional lending, grants, technical assistance, and policy dialogue.</narrative>
  </description>
